OL,3,GNEWSAChaplain settles LGBT sermon
OL,4,Aunfair dismissal case
OL,5,
OL,6,FA chaplain who used a sermon to tell
OL,7,Fpupils they did not have to believe in
OL,8,F"LGBT stuff" has reached a legal
OL,9,Fagreement with the school that
OL,10,Fdismissed him.
OL,12,FRev Bernard Randall was sacked by Trent
OL,13,FCollege in Long Eaton, Derbyshire, in
OL,14,F2019, two months after the sermon. He
OL,15,Fappealed and his dismissal was
OL,16,Foverturned, but he was later made
OL,17,Fredundant after refusing reduced hours.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
