OL,3,GNEWSAChaplain settles LGBT sermon
OL,4,Aunfair dismissal case
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter losing an unfair dismissal claim,
OL,7,Fhis case had been set for a new
OL,8,Ftribunal over possible bias on the
OL,9,Fpanel that made the ruling, and Trent
OL,10,FCollege was ordered to pay Randall
OL,11,Fabout #20,000 in costs, according to a
OL,12,Fcourt document.
OL,14,FAdvocacy group Christian Concern said a
OL,15,Fconfidential settlement had since been
OL,16,Freached.
